QuestGuidance.Register("en",451,{
[14401]="700247B5\n1\tDeliver the broken longswords to the hobbit Parr Chopley at the outpost of Ost Forod\030Collect broken longswords (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect the broken longswords from the goblins or tomb-robbers surrounding the haven outpost of Ost Forod in Evendim. You are to deliver the items to Parr Chopley, a hobbit, living in the settlement.\n",
[14402]="7002479F\n1\tDeliver the broken short bows to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect broken short bows (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting broken short bows from the brigands in the ruins surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14403]="700247AD\n1\tDeliver the fine fur to the hobbit Parr Chopley at the outpost of Ost Forod\030Collect fine fur (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect the fine fur from the beasts surrounding the haven outpost of Ost Forod in Evendim. You are to deliver the items to Parr Chopley, a hobbit, living in the settlement.\n",
[14404]="700247AC\n1\tDeliver the fine skin to the hobbit Parr Chopley at the outpost of Ost Forod\030Collect fine skin (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect the fine skin from the beasts surrounding the haven outpost of Ost Forod in Evendim. You are to deliver the items to Parr Chopley, a hobbit, living in the settlement.\n",
[14405]="700247A9\n1\tDeliver the heavy carapaces to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect heavy carapaces (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting heavy carapaces from the insects to the west of Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14406]="700247A2\n1\tDeliver the heavy sword sheaths to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect heavy sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting heavy sword sheaths from the brigands surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14407]="700247B3\n1\tDeliver the leathery fur to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect leathery fur (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting leathery fur from the beasts surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14408]="700247B1\n1\tDeliver the muted dust to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect muted dust (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting muted dust from the Dead surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14409]="700247A6\n1\tDeliver the new sword sheaths to the hobbit Parr Chopley at the outpost of Ost Forod\030Collect new sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect the new sword sheaths from the goblins or tomb-robbers surrounding the haven outpost of Ost Forod in Evendim. You are to deliver the items to Parr Chopley, a hobbit, living in the settlement.\n",
[14410]="700247A4\n1\tDeliver the scarred ears to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect scarred ears (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting scarred ears from the beasts surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14411]="700247AA\n1\tDeliver the shimmering essence to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect shimmering essence (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting shimmering essence from the Dead surrounding Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14412]="700247A5\n1\tDeliver the soft skin to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect soft skin (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting soft skin from the beasts and lizard-like creatures to the west of Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14413]="700247B9\n1\tDeliver the sticky filth to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect sticky filth (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting sticky filth from the insects west of Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14414]="700247B2\n1\tDeliver the studded sword sheaths to Eirieniel at the Ranger camp in Annúminas\030Collect studded sword sheaths (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect studded sword sheaths from the Angmarim infesting the city of Annúminas and deliver them to Eirieniel at the Ranger-camp within the city.\n",
[14415]="700247B4\n1\tDeliver the very sharp claws to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect very sharp claws (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting very sharp claws from the turtles and toads west of Tinnudir. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
[14416]="7003046E\n1\tEnter Wódscrafen\tTombs of the draug can surely be found in Wódscrafen. You should burn the tombs of the draug.\n2\tBurn tombs of the draug (total: 6)\tTombs of the draug can surely be found in Wódscrafen. You should burn the tombs of the draug.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have burned the tombs of the dead in Wódscrafen. Hopefully, this will be enough to ensure that they do not return to trouble the living.\n",
[14417]="700169C3\n1\tThe rune-rock lies near Mazam-dûm, on the eastern shore of the lake in the Foundations of Stone. Wéorn would like you to press upon certain runes on a rune-rock in order and see what happens.\t\n2\tTalk to Wéorn at Shadowed Refuge\tWéorn is at the Shadowed Refuge in the Foundations of Stone. You should return to Wéorn and relate how the rune-rock irritated a Nameless creature enough to draw it out of hiding.\n",
[14418]="70041AF3\n1\tExpel Dead from the ancient structures (total: 4)\030Defeat Ruthless Dead (total: 8)\tAncient structures can be found in Dâr Matum and the western end of Nimrond. You should expel the Dead from structures in the north-western part of Ringló Vale.\n2\tSpeak with Arvaethor\tArvaethor is in the village of Ethring. You should speak with Arvaethor.\n",
[14419]="70029B09\n1\tDefeat the Master of the East Ward\030Defeat the Master of the North Ward\030Defeat the Master of the West Ward\tThe Masters can be found at each of the spokes of the roads that dissect the Ring of Isengard. Dagoras has instructed you to defeat the Master of each of the wards of Isengard.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras within the Ring of Isengard\tDagoras is hiding within the Ring of Isengard. You should return to Dagoras with news of your success.\n",
[14420]="700375D4\n1\tTalk to Fríthbert\tReeve Fríthbert is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Thane Ordlac asked you to speak with Reeve Fríthbert and learn what might be done to calm Edhild's tears.\n2\tFind Engifu at Reeve Fríthild's house\tEngifu, the children's governess, is at Reeve Fríthild's house, east of the Mead Hall. Fríthbert asked you to bring Engifu to the Mead Hall to comfort Edhild.\n3\tTalk to Alfbert\tAlfbert should be somewhere in Stoke, perhaps at the inn. You should find Alfbert and ask him what is going on.\n4\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac is in the Mead Hall of Stoke. Alfbert suggested that you ask Thane Ordlac for an explanation for the replacement of the Stoke guards with his own.\n",
[14421]="70009986\n1\tGather Gauradan-wards (total: 5)\tRemmenylf has asked you to steal a number of the wards that are scattered around the Gauradan-encampments. The Gauradan-encampments are north of the Eavespires.\n2\tBring the Gauradan-wards to Remmenylf\tRemmenylf is at the Eavespires, south of the Gauradan-encampments. You should bring the Gauradan-wards you collected to Remmenylf.\n",
[14422]="7005A66E\n1\tDefeat Warg champions in Azanulbizar.\t\n2\tReturn to Valdi\tValdi can be found in Amdân. You should talk to Valdi.\n",
[14423]="700082EE\n1\tDefeat Wargs (total: 15)\tWargs prowl the plains and foothills of Nan Amlug and Rhunenlad, east of Esteldín. You should hunt down and slay the cruel hounds of the Enemy.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have assisted the Rangers of Esteldín in their daily vigilance, maintaining that the lands of the North Downs are free from enemy control.\n",
[14424]="700082F0\n1\tDefeat Raugzok\tRaugzok, chief of the Wargs, can be found at Dol Dínen in the south-eastern North Downs. You should defeat Raugzok.\n2\tDefeat Raugzok\tRaugzok, chief of the Wargs, can be found at Dol Dínen in the south-eastern North Downs. You should defeat Raugzok.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Raugzok, chief among the Wargs of Dol Dínen. Your efforts have done much to preserve the North Downs from the ravages of war.\n",
[14425]="7002C6EF\n1\tPlant mint to ward off the Wargs (total: 9)\tThe Old Burrows are on the western edge of Thinglad, south of Haldirith. You should plant the mint in soil at the Old Burrows.\n2\tReturn to Renfaer\tRenfaer is at his new watchpost in the centre of Thinglad. You should return to Renfaer.\n",
[14426]="700577DA\n1\tDefeat Warg-riders in the Floodfells\tWarg-riders are a dangerous threat to the people who live within the Floodfells, and those who must adventure there.\n2\tDefeat Warg-riders in the Floodfells (total: 8)\tWarg-riders from Gundabad threaten the peace and safety of those who live within the Floodfells.\n3\tCompleted\tYou defeated many Warg-riders within the Floodwells.\n",
[14427]="70037159\n1\tDefeat goblin-spearmen\tYou should drive off the goblin-spearmen burning and pillaging in the Broadacres.\n2\tDefeat goblin-spearmen (total: 6)\tGoblin-spearmen may be found throughout the fields south of Torsbury. You should drive off the goblin-spearmen burning and pillaging in the Broadacres.\n",
[14428]="7000185B\n1\tDefeat Wargs (total: 8)\tThere are Wargs in the areas west and south of Esteldín. In order to protect the secrecy of Esteldín, Dagoras has asked you to hunt down and slay as many Wargs as you can.\n2\tTalk to Dagoras\tDagoras is at Esteldín. Dagoras, the Ranger Watch-captain, asked you to hunt the Wargs of the North Downs in order to protect the location of Esteldín. You should return to him with word of your success.\n",
[14429]="700577DC\n1\tDefeat wargs in Ujâk-fulug\tWargs have made a den in Ujâk-fulug, and they must be defeated before they can threaten the people of the Floodfells.\n2\tDefeat wargs in Ujâk-fulug (total: 12)\tWargs have made a den in Ujâk-fulug, and they must be defeated before they can threaten the people of the Floodfells.\n3\tCompleted\tYou defeated many wargs in Ujâk-fulug, ensuring the safety of the folk who live in the Floodfells.\n",
[14430]="70065B69\n1\tDefeat wargs at Galdir's Dell (total: 12)\tMallenor has asked you to defeat wargs at Galdir's Dell east of Arnach.\n2\tTalk to Mallenor\tYou have dispatched as many wargs as you can. You should inform Mallenor of your progress. Mallenor is in Imloth Melui.\n",
[14431]="7002C6EE\n1\tDefeat Wargs at the Old Burrow (total: 12)\tWargs are along the south-western edge of Thinglad in the Old Burrows. You should slay many Wargs in the Old Burrows.\n2\tTalk to Renfaer\tRenfaer can be found near the centre of the woods of Thinglad. You should speak with Renfaer.\n",
[14432]="700379DE\n1\tDefeat Wargs in the Westfold (total: 8)\tWargs can be found roaming the plains of the eastern Westfold. You should defeat Wargs in the Westfold.\n2\tReturn to Winmar\tWinmar can be found afield north of Grimslade. You should speak with Winmar.\n",
})
